  "prefLabel": "Env-A 601.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-10-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement the permitting requirements of RSA 125-C and RSA 125-I to regulate the operation and modification of new and existing stationary sources, area sources, and devices in order to achieve and maintain:\n\n(a) The ambient air quality standards established pursuant to RSA 125-C and Env-A 300; and\n\n(b) The ambient air limits for regulated toxic air pollutants established pursuant to RSA 125-I and Env-A 1400.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.16 eff 12-7-75; ss by #1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #6468-B, eff 3-5-97; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
